step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple best_single strategy to see if a single strong model outperforms the robust pool combination.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a robust median on the most stable small pool (pool1) to see if it outperforms the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test trimmed_mean over the full pool to see if including all models improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test median over pool3 to see if a smaller robust pool improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Evaluate a DTW barycenter over pool3 to see if a different aggregation can beat the trimmed mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: test a robust median on the smaller pool2 to see if fewer models help stability.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test dba on pool1 to see if a smaller DTW barycenter works better than pool3.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test the remaining untried dba on pool2 to see if it outperforms the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a weighted combination on pool3 using inverse_error weights to see if a data‑driven weighting beats the trimmed_mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","rf","catboost","DWT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if expanding the pool improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool4 to see if a different robust pool improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Try a trimmed mean on pool4 to see if adding the extra rf model helps robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

